/bin/
/dist/
/tmp/
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
# Runtime output lives under the dev storage_root (./var). These were
# previously bare "hls/" and "recordings/" — unanchored, so they also
# matched the internal/hls source package and silently un-tracked it.
/var/
web/node_modules/
web/.next/
web/out/
web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
.env
*.log
# A channel list is a property of where the aerial is, not of the source: the
# frequencies here are one flat in Tokyo. A fresh start with no list sweeps the
# band and writes its own (cmd/isdbd/main.go), so tracking one only meant every
# install began by inheriting someone else's muxes.
/channels.json
/isdbd
/ferrite-tui
/target/
